WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.969
- We've actually made
titty tassels before.

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:03.261
- (laughs) Pretty cool

00:00:03.261 --> 00:00:07.517
(upbeat music)
(hinges creak)

00:00:07.517 --> 00:00:08.793
- I'm getting married in a couple weeks,

00:00:08.793 --> 00:00:10.356
and I'm super excited.

00:00:10.356 --> 00:00:13.228
For many reasons, not least
of which is to be done

00:00:13.228 --> 00:00:14.860
with wedding planning.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.443
Wedding planning is not
for the faint of heart.

00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:19.297
There are so many details,

00:00:19.297 --> 00:00:21.316
your emotions are all wrapped up in it,

00:00:21.316 --> 00:00:25.468
and everything is so goddamned expensive.

00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:28.078
I started to think maybe I
should just DIY it a lot more,

00:00:28.078 --> 00:00:29.343
and so I searched on Pinterest

00:00:29.343 --> 00:00:33.037
for the easiest wedding
decorations you could make.

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:35.226
I found a bunch, and then I realized

00:00:35.226 --> 00:00:38.047
I do not have the emotional
bandwidth at this time

00:00:38.047 --> 00:00:40.759
to even begin to start a DIY project.

00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:43.721
So, I'm making my coworkers
and friends try it.

00:00:43.721 --> 00:00:46.300
I got a married couple,
I got an engaged couple.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.835
Let's see what they can do.

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:50.766
- We are planning a wedding,
and it is horrifying.

00:00:50.766 --> 00:00:51.971
- We got married last year.

00:00:51.971 --> 00:00:53.242
We had our one-year
anniversary this Summer.

00:00:53.242 --> 00:00:54.075
- Yeah, we did.

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:54.908
- It's a lot.

00:00:54.908 --> 00:00:56.412
- Yeah, there is so much to do.

00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:58.138
There are so many tiny details.

00:00:58.138 --> 00:01:00.790
- We have both South
Asian and African Family.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:01.930
It was three days, as well.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:04.580
- I have a ton of DIY stuff pinned.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:05.413
- Yeah.

00:01:05.413 --> 00:01:07.902
- But, I also know myself,

00:01:07.902 --> 00:01:11.735
and I know I'm not that
good at making things.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.098
- But there were these
just huge 3-D flowers

00:01:15.098 --> 00:01:16.329
that I wanted to make.
(man laughs)

00:01:16.329 --> 00:01:17.583
I even did a practice
round of making them,

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:19.875
but it totally was a disaster.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:21.592
- I think I'll be better than Sarah.

00:01:21.592 --> 00:01:23.100
- He's probably right. (laughs)

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.517
(rock music)

00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:29.725
- It looks like it's tassels that

00:01:29.725 --> 00:01:31.838
hang like this from a string.

00:01:31.838 --> 00:01:32.970
- Two at once, or one first and then

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.011
figure it out.
- Ooh, yeah yeah yeah,

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:34.844
let's do some layers!

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:36.703
- No, I didn't mean two, I
mean two at once, like you --

00:01:36.703 --> 00:01:37.870
- Nah, nah, let's do layers!

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:39.471
- Fold a piece of tissue paper in half,

00:01:39.471 --> 00:01:40.696
and then half the other way.

00:01:40.696 --> 00:01:42.602
Cut strips toward the
fold to create fringe,

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:45.245
leaving about one inch
uncut at the fold line.

00:01:45.245 --> 00:01:46.239
- You know.
- We're already going

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.388
off the script.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:47.388 --> 00:01:50.214
- Partway through my first
piece of tissue paper,

00:01:50.214 --> 00:01:52.336
and I'm already over it.

00:01:52.336 --> 00:01:53.876
- Like, these are for a wedding,

00:01:53.876 --> 00:01:55.617
can you please take this seriously?

00:01:55.617 --> 00:01:57.796
- Mine are way thicker than yours.

00:01:57.796 --> 00:01:58.910
Like, mine are thick.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.986
- That's good cuts?

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.260
- They're better than mine.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.832
- What's does fringe mean? I
don't know what that means.

00:02:02.832 --> 00:02:03.665
- Funny like,

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:04.979
blunt-rolling technique,
(laughs)

00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:06.508
like with tassels at the end of it.

00:02:06.508 --> 00:02:08.006
- No, but, what's the next step?

00:02:08.006 --> 00:02:09.440
- I don't know, I feel
like you just tie it.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.160
- They make a loop?

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.731
- That'll have to do I think.
(snickers)

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.784
- Ooh!
- Tassels!

00:02:14.784 --> 00:02:18.308
- I think it would take
at least 8 hours to make

00:02:18.308 --> 00:02:19.759
a wedding's worth
- There's no way.

00:02:19.759 --> 00:02:20.949
- of these tassels.

00:02:20.949 --> 00:02:22.393
- But it doesn't look very good.

00:02:22.393 --> 00:02:24.542
- They don't look good at all.

00:02:24.542 --> 00:02:25.375
- We're not gonna make tassels.

00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:26.208
(scoffs)

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:29.487
(old timey music)

00:02:29.487 --> 00:02:32.408
- We're about to do like
DIY flower centerpieces

00:02:32.408 --> 00:02:33.479
out of paper.

00:02:33.479 --> 00:02:35.445
And I'm actually interested in this.

00:02:35.445 --> 00:02:37.898
- I knew flowers would be expensive,

00:02:37.898 --> 00:02:40.191
but I didn't realize how expensive!

00:02:40.191 --> 00:02:41.199
- Yeap. Yeah.

00:02:41.199 --> 00:02:44.267
- I've heard of people
making fabric flowers.

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:45.424
I'm considering it.

00:02:45.424 --> 00:02:46.499
- I think we wanna make the petal.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.178
A bunch of petals and
then we tie them together.

00:02:48.178 --> 00:02:49.421
Alright, so let's just make some petals.

00:02:49.421 --> 00:02:51.186
- It's starting to look like a flower.

00:02:51.186 --> 00:02:52.640
- Yeah, brag about it.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.579
- How do you change directions?

00:02:54.579 --> 00:02:56.363
- Just like... you know, just like, flow!

00:02:56.363 --> 00:02:58.151
- Just to show you what Sarah just did.

00:02:58.151 --> 00:03:00.437
She used the instructions
portion of the tape--

00:03:00.437 --> 00:03:02.409
- I'm so stressed out, like...

00:03:02.409 --> 00:03:03.242
(sighs)

00:03:03.242 --> 00:03:04.241
- They were like this,

00:03:04.241 --> 00:03:05.749
and then the next picture's
like a beautiful flower.

00:03:05.749 --> 00:03:06.949
I don't know how...
(laughs)

00:03:06.949 --> 00:03:08.453
I don't know how it got there.

00:03:08.453 --> 00:03:10.176
- Go for it, go for it.

00:03:10.176 --> 00:03:12.343
- I'm, like, gonna go
on Pinterest and unpin

00:03:12.343 --> 00:03:13.609
everything I ever pinned.

00:03:13.609 --> 00:03:14.940
- Wow!
- I think these look beautiful

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.236
(laughs)

00:03:16.236 --> 00:03:17.285
- Hope you're getting Sarah

00:03:17.285 --> 00:03:20.528
muttering under her breath
while she makes flowers.

00:03:20.528 --> 00:03:21.480
- We are not done!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.864
- I refuse to make another one.

00:03:22.864 --> 00:03:25.203
- No! (laughs)
- I'll help you, though.

00:03:25.203 --> 00:03:28.494
- Whoa. (laughs)
- Yours is so bad!

00:03:28.494 --> 00:03:29.995
- That's way too much work!

00:03:29.995 --> 00:03:33.211
Real flowers, it's a plant based material.

00:03:33.211 --> 00:03:34.594
(tropical music)

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:37.368
- We are now going to
make marbled votives.

00:03:37.368 --> 00:03:38.451
- This is the votive.

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:39.612
- You put a candle in it.

00:03:39.612 --> 00:03:40.741
- You just like, drop, drop, drop.

00:03:40.741 --> 00:03:41.727
Roll, roll, roll.

00:03:41.727 --> 00:03:42.560
Done!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.803
- Put a few drops of
nail polish in the water.

00:03:44.803 --> 00:03:46.208
(yelps)

00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:47.713
- All coming off on the toothpick!

00:03:47.713 --> 00:03:48.625
- You're probably going too fast.

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:50.691
(laughs)
- Oh... I ruined it.

00:03:50.691 --> 00:03:52.287
- Please gently dip below the surface.

00:03:52.287 --> 00:03:53.454
- Ooh... roll.

00:03:55.054 --> 00:03:56.428
(laughs)

00:03:56.428 --> 00:03:58.863
- Ooh!
- Okay, roll... Ay!

00:03:58.863 --> 00:04:01.467
Boom!
- Really sick, actually!

00:04:01.467 --> 00:04:02.938
(laughs mockingly)

00:04:02.938 --> 00:04:03.938
- Oh, boy...

00:04:05.916 --> 00:04:08.582
- Oh, man, you spent so
much more time on it.

00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:10.680
And yours looks equally as shitty.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.223
(claps)
- Looks like rainbow throw-up.

00:04:13.223 --> 00:04:15.238
- I'd say the lesson
learned on this one is

00:04:15.238 --> 00:04:16.210
don't do it.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.096
(classical music)

00:04:18.096 --> 00:04:19.758
- Some of this DIY stuff is like...

00:04:19.758 --> 00:04:22.719
I get that you need to have
decorations at your wedding,

00:04:22.719 --> 00:04:25.667
but like, you know... you
can chill out a little bit.

00:04:25.667 --> 00:04:29.162
- It's like communal joy
and also communal suffering

00:04:29.162 --> 00:04:32.469
through DIY projects.
(laughs)

00:04:32.469 --> 00:04:33.897
- Even when it's not DIY.

00:04:33.897 --> 00:04:35.465
- Do you have any faith in me

00:04:35.465 --> 00:04:37.576
to DIY anything at our wedding?

00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:39.702
- Uh, maybe like an outfit for our dog.

00:04:39.702 --> 00:04:40.535
(laughs)

00:04:40.535 --> 00:04:42.175
- But if you're into it, definitely do it,

00:04:42.175 --> 00:04:43.609
because it'll make your wedding

00:04:43.609 --> 00:04:45.653
really unique and personalized.

00:04:45.653 --> 00:04:47.923
- None of this matters, because...

00:04:47.923 --> 00:04:49.446
It's just a wedding.

00:04:49.446 --> 00:04:51.167
- What?!?
(laughs)

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:52.234
I'm just kidding.

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:54.614
Like, what is a baby but, like,

00:04:54.614 --> 00:04:57.743
the world's most important DIY project?

00:04:57.743 --> 00:04:59.003
- That's a stretch.

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:01.836
(classical music)

00:05:04.843 --> 00:05:06.337
(hinges creak)

